			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 8, DX 11, IQ 10, HT 10, HP 8, WILL 12, PER 11, FP 10, SPEED 5.25, MOVE 4, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
